<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="ebe32804-8077-421c-a588-5b549de89995" version="2">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Raze Any City（夷平任意城市）</Name>
    <Description>
    人类玩家和 AI 都可以夷平任意攻占的城市，包括原始首都。
    读取旧档前也可以启用本 mod。之后攻占的城市适用此规则。

    Human and AI players can raze any city they capture, including original capitals.
    You can also enable the mod before loading an existing save. The rule applies to future captures.
    </Description>
    <Created>1769623691</Created>
    <Teaser>
    允许夷平任意攻占的城市。
    Allows razing any captured city.
    </Teaser>
    <Authors>ApprenTice</Authors>
    <AffectsSavedGames>0</AffectsSavedGames>
    <SupportsMultiplayer>1</SupportsMultiplayer>
    <SupportsHotSeat>1</SupportsHotSeat>
    <CompatibleVersions>2.0</CompatibleVersions>
  </Properties>
  <InGameActions>
    <UpdateDatabase id="RazeAnyCity">
      <File>RazeAnyCity.sql</File>
    </UpdateDatabase>
  </InGameActions>
  <Files>
    <File>RazeAnyCity.sql</File>
  </Files>
</Mod>
